Overview

This repository contains my submission for the BlinkMoney Data Analyst Assignment. The assignment focuses on product analytics, event instrumentation, SQL-based funnel analysis, and defining meaningful business metrics for the BlinkMoney Save (SIP) journey.

The objective was to analyze the customer journey from App Open to First Unit Credited, identify user drop-offs, calculate key performance metrics, and design an analytics framework that supports data-driven decision-making.

