Part B – Product Hypothesis

Developed a hypothesis identifying the stage most likely to lose users during the onboarding journey.

The hypothesis includes:

Reasoning behind the assumption
Business impact
Evidence required to validate or reject the hypothesis
Part C – North Star Metric

Selected a North Star Metric that reflects long-term customer value.

North Star Metric

Day-30 Active SIPs

Counter Metric

60-Day SIP Pause/Cancellation Rate

The purpose of these metrics is to encourage sustainable customer engagement rather than optimizing only for initial registrations.

